cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: >-
  The Limits of Clinical Metadata for Cross-Subject Stroke Motor
  Imagery Decoding: Evidence from Anatomy-Aware Relabelling and Alignment
abstract: >-
  Code release for a systematic evaluation of clinical-metadata-driven
  transfer selection in stroke motor-imagery BCIs (50 patients, LOSO).
  Shows that clinical similarity is insufficient as a direct decision
  rule for source selection and validation-based pipeline selection.
